{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">尖沙咀清晨有多人打鬥至少一人傷，警方列傷人案處理，暫時無人被捕。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">現場是棉登徑30號，地上留有血漬，以及酒瓶碎片。有警員在垃圾桶搜索有否與案件有關的物件。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.ASSAULT-0700_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026TosffmmfIq1790635468.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.ASSAULT-0700_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方指凌晨近5時接報聲稱有十多人打鬥，當中有人持刀。警員及救護人員到場，將一名傷者送院治理。他的頭及口流血，施襲者逃離現場。警方正調查事件。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.ASSAULT-0700_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026JRcGsGn4ik1790635472.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.ASSAULT-0700_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-28T22:59:24.060087+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}